   \[
   \frac{1}{3}x + 2
   \]

3. She sold half of what was left at the orange house:
   \[
   \frac{1}{3}x + 2 + \frac{1}{2}\left(x - \frac{1}{3}x - 2\right)
   \]

4. After these sales, she has 5 vacuum cleaners left:
   \[
   x - \frac{1}{3}x - 2 - \frac{1}{2}\left(x - \frac{1}{3}x - 2\right) = 5
   \]

