   \[
   x + \left(-\frac{1}{3}x - \frac{3}{6}x - \frac{3}{6}x\right) + \left(2 + \frac{1}{2}\right) = 5
   \]

9. Simplify the fractions:
   \[
   x + \left(-\frac{1}{3}x - \frac{1}{2}x - \frac{1}{2}x\right) + \left(2 + \frac{1}{2}\right) = 5
   \]

